🔥 Top 20 Kubernetes Interview Questions

1	Explain Kubernetes architecture.	
Control Plane, Worker Nodes, API Server, etcd, Scheduler, Controller Manager, kubelet, kube-proxy

2	What happens when you run kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml?	
Complete request flow from kubectl → API Server → etcd → controllers → scheduler → kubelet

3	What is a Pod? Why can't we deploy containers directly?	
Smallest deployable Kubernetes unit; Pod lifecycle and networking

4	What is the difference between Deployment and Service?	
Deployment manages Pods/replicas; Service provides stable networking/access

5	Explain Deployment, ReplicaSet and Pod relationship.	
Deployment → ReplicaSet → Pods

6	What are different Kubernetes Service types?	
ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer, ExternalName

7	How does Kubernetes networking work?	
Pod-to-Pod, Pod-to-Service, external traffic, CNI

8	What is Ingress? How does it work?	
Ingress resource, Ingress Controller, ALB/Nginx, routing

9	What are ConfigMaps and Secrets?	
Configuration management and sensitive data

10	What are Kubernetes namespaces?	
Resource isolation, RBAC, quotas, environments

11	Explain Kubernetes RBAC.	
User/ServiceAccount, Role, ClusterRole, RoleBinding, ClusterRoleBinding

12	What are Requests and Limits?	
CPU/memory scheduling, throttling, OOMKilled

13	What is HPA? How does it work?	
Horizontal Pod Autoscaler, metrics-server, CPU/memory/custom metrics

14	What is the difference between Liveness, Readiness and Startup probes?	
Container health, traffic readiness, slow application startup

15	How do you troubleshoot a Pod in CrashLoopBackOff?	
kubectl describe, logs, previous logs, events, resources, probes


16	How do you troubleshoot a Pod stuck in Pending?	
Resources, node selectors, taints/tolerations, affinity, PVCs


17	How do you troubleshoot a Kubernetes node in NotReady state?	
kubelet, CNI, disk/memory pressure, container runtime, node conditions


18	Explain Kubernetes storage.	
PV, PVC, StorageClass, dynamic provisioning, CSI


19	How do you perform a Kubernetes/EKS upgrade?	
Version compatibility, control plane, node groups, add-ons, testing, rollback planning

20	How do you back up and restore a Kubernetes cluster?	
etcd/application backup, Velero, PV snapshots, restore process
